This licence covers the source code of this project and nothing else.

Three sets of files in this repository are not covered by it, and each carries
its own notice:

- `validation/reference/` and `data/epv/fot_epv_grid_32x50.csv` are vendored
  from Friends-of-Tracking-Data-FoTD/LaurieOnTracking, MIT, Copyright (c) 2021
  Friends-of-Tracking-Data-FoTD. Their licence text ships beside them as
  `validation/reference/LICENSE` and `data/epv/LICENSE.friends-of-tracking`,
  and those two files must stay exactly as they are: they are that project's
  grant, not this one's.
- `data/demo/` holds a derived representation of Metrica Sports sample data.
  Metrica publish no licence, so no grant is offered or implied for those two
  parquet files. See `data/demo/NOTICE.md`.
- `data/transfermarkt/` is a column-reduced snapshot of
  dcaribou/transfermarkt-datasets (CC0-1.0 over that repackaging only). See
  `data/transfermarkt/NOTICE.md`.

StatsBomb data is never committed here in any form; where this project's own
code reads it, the StatsBomb Public Data User Agreement governs that use.
